    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Farhan Vakani, Assistant Manager, Department of Continuing Professional Education, has been nominated for Hubert H. Humphrey Fellowship Award 2014-15. The Hubert H. Humphrey Fellowship Program provides a year of professional enrichment in the United States for experienced professionals from designated countries throughout the world. The Humphrey Program is a Fulbright exchange activity. Its primary funding is provided by the U.S. Congress through the Bureau of Educational and Cultural Affairs of the U.S. Department of State. The Institute of International Education (IIE) assists the U.S. Department of State in administering the Humphrey Fellowship Program.",
